        <mxCell id="c47" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;A failed file never stops the import: read errors, archive limits, empty or binary files, no importer, no events and contained panics (a crashed plugin process too) become an &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:ui-monospace,SF Mono,Cascadia Mono,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;UnrecognizedFile&lt;/span&gt; with its reason. Files cancelled are listed as “Not imported”.&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#14171C,#ECEEF1);rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#C4C7CD,#353A42);fillColor=light-dark(#F0F2F5,#1B1E23);align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="992" y="1037" width="360" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
